    "Id": "mechdef_nixe_NX-C",
    "Name": "Nixe NX-C",
    "Details": "The C configuration of the Nixe OmniProtoMech is a support loadout that mounts two LRM-12 launchers in the main gun mount. Their ammunition bins hold enough missiles for a long stretch of constant salvos, but once they run dry the configuration would be almost helpless against its enemies. For this reason the designers also added a Light Machine Gun to deal with lesser threats and limit the consumption of LRM ammunition.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: OmniProtoMech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>",
    "Icon": "Protomech_Boggart"
  },
